  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Baltic County 2003</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Baltikum l&#xe4;n 2003</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L&#xe4;nsstyrelserna har sedan 1992 f&#xe5;tt st&#xf6;d till samarbetet med sina baltiska motparter. Syftet med samarbetet &#xe4;r kunskaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring samt att utbyta erfarenheter. Omr&#xe5;den av s&#xe4;rskilt intresse &#xe4;r offentlig administration p&#xe5; regional niv&#xe5;, sociala sektorn, EU-integration och kapacitetsuppbyggnad p&#xe5; regional niv&#xe5; inf&#xf6; implementering av strukturfonder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish County administration boards have since 1992 received support for their cooperation with their counterparts in Estonia, Latvia and Lithuania. The aim of the cooperation is to transfer knowledge and exchange experience. Special interests are: public administration on regional level, social sector, EU-integration and capacity building on regional level for implementation of Struct fund</narrative>
  </description>
